From c6dc5b2197034faf31351ae02d6f90686ff401aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jianwei Fan <jianwei.fan@rock-chips.com>
Date: Thu, 21 Dec 2023 06:28:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 222/232] media: i2c: rk628: add csi1 support for rk628f

Signed-off-by: Jianwei Fan <jianwei.fan@rock-chips.com>
Change-Id: I6af3ec337adebd4c1283d4c717cb74f5701b80df
Signed-off-by: Guochun Huang <hero.huang@rock-chips.com>
---
 drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628.c            |  26 ++
 drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628.h            |  16 ++
 drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_bt1120_csi.c |   4 +-
 drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_cru.c        |   1 +
 drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_cru.h        |   1 +
 drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_csi.c        |   4 +-
 drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_csi.h        |  29 +++
 drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_csi_v4l2.c   | 288 ++++++++++++++++++---
